"Meiling looks like she shares the bloodline of the Heavenly Demon Yulong."
"Yulong has claimed blood kinship with Meiling; she denies it as false."
"At the Solstice Meiling brewed the Horn of the Azure Dragon, a poison that could waste land forever."
"On the journey Meiling will go incognito as 'Lin Liling'."
"Meiling will gift the Blazing Swords their reed-and-silk battle banners."
